            "review_title": "Review at Soc San Si",
            "review_text": "Thảo Linh N\n1 contribution\n0\nExcellent fresh fruit tea\nJan 2017 • Friends\nJust a small drink stall, but very very nice fresh fruit tea and milk tea. They have ginger lemongrass tea, guava tea, strawberry and cherry tea with homemade local recipes. I especially loved Guava and ginger lemongrass tea. My Korean friends did love the milk tea here a lot!!!!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 3, 2017",
